<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 3-mth budget deficit 648 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine 3-mth budget deficit 648 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines posted a budget deficit of 648 million pesos for the first three months of 1997 versus the year-ago deficit of 1.571 billion pesos, the Bureau of Treasury said on Friday.</p>
</text>
